# L-SDF Index: js/core
# Subsystem: Core Engine, State, Storage, and Lifecycle

§ CORE_SUBSYSTEM
├── ◈ app.js                 :: Application coordinator (draw loop, camera, layout algorithms, hit test)
├── ◈ layoutEngine.js        :: Master 40px grid, count-based optimal alignment, group clustering, world grid drawing
├── ◇ state.js               :: AppState singleton (document, view, session, history snapshots)
├── ◈ boardManager.js        :: Multi-board repository, persistence, import/export
├── ◈ dragManager.js         :: Drag calculations, spatial movement, containment
├── ◈ backgroundBuilder.js   :: Canvas patterns, theme backgrounds
├── ◈ previewRenderer.js     :: Thumbnail generation for cards & boards
├── ◈ syncBridge.js          :: Bi-directional event bus
├── ⚙ schema.js              :: Theme schemas and color validation
├── ⚙ constants.js           :: Node metrics, default geometry
└── ⚡ actions.js             :: Command registry & modal mappings
